          <a href="/dashboard/register" class="inline-flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white px-6 font-bold text-[#c73e2c] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white focus:ring-offset-2">Start with CommsHQ</a>
